<section class="relative bg-black pt-32 md:pt-44 pb-10 md:pb-14 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_0%,_transparent_70%)]"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <p class="reveal text-white/40 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-8" style="--reveal-y: 20px; --reveal-duration: 0.6s">
      About the game
    </p>
    <h2 class="reveal text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight" style="--reveal-y: 40px; --reveal-delay: 0.1s">
      You return to an <span class="font-serif italic text-white/60">empty house</span> with a lantern.
      <br class="hidden md:block" />
      <span class="font-serif italic text-white/60">It is not haunted. It is loyal.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-10 max-w-2xl text-white/60 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="--reveal-y: 30px; --reveal-delay: 0.2s">
      The clock still keeps the hour the family gathered, the moonflower still waits for its light, the music box still knows the tune.
      In the Dream you can see what each object is waiting for. In Reality you collect what it gives back.
      Three rooms, one photograph torn into three pieces, and a house that is warm again at the end.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
